      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Absolutely not, giving him a double dose of iron is dangerous and could cause severe stomach pain or even liver damage.\nIron toxicity is real, and your son needs the exact prescribed amount, not a \"more is better\" approach.\nHe should stick to the doctor's dosage and maybe add some vitamin C to help absorption, but never exceed the limit.\nIf he's still tired after a few days, he should see a doctor again to check his levels.",
