    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, it sounds really scary when you put it that way. but the doctor's office is so hard to get an appointment with and i just hate seeing him so drained every single day. \n\nif i'm nervous about the 325mg being too much, is there like a middle ground? like if i just do 200mg or something higher than the standard dose but not the full 325? i just feel like something is better than nothing if we want to see progress before his next checkup in a month.",
